# Binary-fixture markers for the Certificates test corpus.
#
# Policy: Git LFS MUST NOT be used for these files going forward.
# Historical commits already store some of these as LFS pointers — that
# is unavoidable for past commits but no future commit should add LFS
# tracking. The `-text` attribute keeps Git from attempting line-ending
# normalization or text diffs on binary content.
#
# When a new binary fixture type emerges (e.g., TPM 2.0 blobs), add it
# here with `-text` only.
#
# PEM-formatted fixtures (.pem, .asc) stay in plain Git — they are text
# and diff well.

# DER-encoded X.509 artifacts
*.der -text
*.crl -text

# Java keystores
*.jks -text
*.jceks -text
*.bks -text

# PKCS#12
*.p12 -text
*.pfx -text

# PGP binary
*.gpg -text
*.pgp -text

# Catch-all for random-noise edge-case binary fixtures
*.bin -text
